# Every file here is generated output, copied byte-for-byte from the build.
#
# ⚠️ NO LINE-ENDING CONVERSION. Without this, git rewrites the working copy to
# CRLF on checkout, the emit then compares those bytes against an LF bundle and
# reports every file as changed on every publish — a diff that is always dirty
# is a diff nobody reads. It also means the CNAME on disk stops being the one
# line the build wrote.
* -text
